  "description": "Make your designs stand out with the bold, urban energy of Graffiti Limit, a dynamic graffiti-style font inspired by street art culture and raw creative expression. With its edgy strokes, expressive curves, and authentic hand-drawn feel, this font captures the spirit of city walls, murals, and underground artistry.\nPerfect for posters, apparel, album covers, branding, and social media graphics, Graffiti Limit adds attitude and personality to any project. Whether you’re aiming for a gritty street vibe or a modern urban aesthetic, this font gives you the freedom to push creative boundaries and make a lasting impression.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Make your designs stand out with the bold, urban energy of Graffiti Limit, a dynamic graffiti-style font inspired by street art culture and raw creative expression. With its edgy strokes, expressive curves, and authentic hand-drawn feel, this font captures the spirit of city walls, murals, and underground artistry.</p>\n<p>Perfect for posters, apparel, album covers, branding, and social media graphics, Graffiti Limit adds attitude and personality to any project. Whether you’re aiming for a gritty street vibe or a modern urban aesthetic, this font gives you the freedom to push creative boundaries and make a lasting impression.</p>",
